        "reference": "https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/lebs103.pdf"
      },
      "facts": {
        "decisive-excerpt": {
          "text": "Short and long term interest rates significantly affect the demand for product and services. For example, in case of construction companies and automobile manufacturers, low longer ­term rates are beneficial because they result in increased spending by consumers for buying homes and cars on borrowed money."
        }
      },
      "supports": {
