      },
      "facts": {
        "decisive-excerpt": {
          "text": "Fiscal deficit is the difference between the government’s total expenditure and its total receipts excluding borrowing Gross fiscal deficit = Total expenditure – (Revenue receipts + Non-debt creating capital receipts"
        }
